&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Castrol is one of the world’s leading lubricant brands, serving customers and consumers in the automotive, marine, industrial and energy sectors. Castrol brands are recognised globally for their premium quality and high performance, shaped by the company’s commitment to innovation and cutting-edge technology. With products sold in more than 150 countries, Castrol has helped keep things moving on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt; roads &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;and racetracks, air, sea, and space for over 125 years.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Whether you&#39;re just starting out or ready for your next big move, you&#39;re in the right place to explore an exciting career with Castrol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to shape and lead Castrol’s employee listening and people analytics capability during a critical period of organisational transformation. As the Employee Experience &amp;amp; People Analytics Lead, you will act as the central expert and trusted advisor for employee listening across the business, partnering closely with senior leaders, HR Business Partners, Centres of Expertise, and transformation teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will have ownership of Castrol’s employee listening platform and strategy, ensuring employee feedback is translated into meaningful action that improves engagement, culture, organisational effectiveness, and business performance. With approximately 6,300 employees across 40 countries, the role offers significant global exposure and the opportunity to influence decision-making at the highest levels.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a highly visible, business-facing role that goes beyond survey administration. Success will come from your ability to combine employee experience expertise, people analytics, stakeholder management, and data storytelling to help leaders make evidence-based decisions during a period of ongoing change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Castrol&#39;s Employee Listening Capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for all employee listening and survey activity across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the implementation, configuration, governance, administration, and continuous improvement of the Qualtrics Employee Experience platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver a range of employee listening initiatives, including engagement surveys, pulse surveys, lifecycle surveys, moments that matter surveys, and transformation-related listening programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain an employee listening strategy that aligns with Castrol&#39;s transformation agenda and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish governance frameworks, survey standards, and reporting methodologies that ensure data privacy, consistency, and insight quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actionable workforce insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse employee experience, workforce, talent, and organisational data to identify trends, risks, opportunities, and areas for intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine multiple data sources to provide leadership with a holistic view of organisational health and workforce effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support workforce planning, organisational design, talent management, employee engagement, and retention initiatives through data-driven insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify leading indicators and predictive insights that help anticipate workforce risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence decision-making through reporting and storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create executive dashboards, leadership scorecards, PowerPoint presentations, and insight packs that translate data into compelling business narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings and recommendations to senior stakeholders and leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate action-planning discussions and workshops that help leaders convert employee feedback into meaningful organisational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, providing evidence-based recommendations on employee experience and workforce challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience needed&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Employee Experience, People Analytics, or Organisational Effectiveness professional who combines deep technical expertise with strong consulting and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant hands-on experience with Qualtrics or similar survey software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading or playing a major role in a full Qualtrics implementation from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 5+ years of experience working with employee listening platforms, survey technology, and survey design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building dashboards, managing enterprise reporting frameworks, and generating actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people analytics capability, with experience turning workforce and engagement data into compelling recommendations for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating within large, complex organisations of 1,000+ employees, ideally in global environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience supporting employee listening programmes across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel and PowerPoint skills, with the ability to analyse data and communicate findings effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global employee populations and large-scale change or transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with alternative employee listening platforms such as Medallia, Peakon, Glint, InMoment, or similar technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in employee listening governance, data privacy, survey methodology, and enterprise-scale deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence senior leaders and drive action from insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating executive dashboards, scorecards, and board-level reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are particularly interested in candidates who have deployed and operated enterprise-scale employee listening programmes rather than those whose experience is limited to academic or survey administration use cases. You should be able to demonstrate how you have used employee feedback, people analytics, and business insight to influence decisions, improve employee experience, and deliver measurable organisational outcomes. Industry background is not important. We are far more interested in your expertise in employee listening, Qualtrics, people analytics, and your ability to partner with leaders to drive meaningful change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;The Castrol entity recruiting for this role is the data controller for the personal information you provide. We use it to assess your application and to manage the recruitment and onboarding process. We may share it with service providers who support our recruitment, and it may be transferred to other Castrol entities internationally under appropriate safeguards. We keep it only for as long as necessary. For details of how we use your information and your data protection rights, contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;OWAcac3778b-aec2-4e71-7765-87f7daa1b8b6&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, socioeconomic status, neurodiversity/neurocognitive functioning, veteran status or disability status. Individuals with an accessibility need may request an adjustment/accommodation related to Castrol recruiting process (e.g., accessing the job application, completing required assessments, participating in telephone screenings or interviews, etc.).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are selected for a position and depending upon your role, your employment may be contingent upon adherence to local policy. This may include pre-placement drug screening, medical review of physical fitness for the role, and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;VP, Strategic Data Science&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the strategic data-science capability within our &lt;strong&gt;Open Intelligence Solutions (OIS)&lt;/strong&gt; domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a newly defined senior leadership role for someone who can combine &lt;strong&gt;deep data-science expertise with strong media, marketing and commercial understanding&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll sit at the intersection of data science, product, clients and commercial strategy, turning complex data and business challenges into advanced modelling approaches, actionable insights and scalable analytical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll shape how we use data science to understand audiences and consumer behaviour, improve measurement and forecasting, automate consumer research, generate insight and develop synthetic populations and panels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is not a role focused solely on technical delivery. You’ll be a senior strategic partner to clients and internal stakeholders, helping define &lt;strong&gt;what we should build, why it matters and how data science can create measurable business value&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Lead our strategic data-science capability&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vision, strategy and operating model for data science across domain intelligence solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set best practices and standards for how advanced analytics supports client, product and commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of audience definition, segmentation and behavioural modelling approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into actionable audience and consumer intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn client needs and commercial opportunities into clear modelling roadmaps, analytical frameworks and reusable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Drive measurement, forecasting and insight&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices across measurement, media effectiveness and insight generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead forecasting and predictive analytics across audience, consumer and media intelligence use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale consumer-research automation approaches that increase the speed, consistency and depth of insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of &lt;strong&gt;synthetic populations and synthetic panels&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring methodologies are credible, interpretable and commercially useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure analytical approaches are rigorous, explainable and capable of being applied across real client challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Partner with clients and lead teams&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior client and stakeholder partner, shaping solutions that have clear commercial relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Commercial, Consumer Research, Measurement, Forecasting, Audience Strategy and Applied Data Science teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic direction across flagship data-science initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop senior applied data scientists working across audience and segmentation modelling, consumer and media intelligence, forecasting, predictive analytics, synthetic populations and panels, and media effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set quality standards that ensure our work is rigorous, scalable, reusable and commercially valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced data-science leader who can operate comfortably between &lt;strong&gt;strategy, technology and commercial delivery&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading &lt;strong&gt;data science, advanced analytics or applied data-science teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in areas such as &lt;strong&gt;audience modelling, segmentation, behavioural modelling, forecasting, predictive analytics, measurement or consumer intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;media, marketing and/or advertising&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to apply data science to real-world commercial challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating complex client or business problems into practical analytical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing methodologies, frameworks or analytical products that can be scaled and reused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of measurement and media effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with senior clients and stakeholders and communicating complex technical concepts in a clear, commercially relevant way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to provide strategic direction while remaining close enough to the technical detail to challenge assumptions and maintain high standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills, with experience developing senior data-science talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:261,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:261,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP’s Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions is WPP’s unified global data and technology organisation. We build the platforms, products, and engineering capabilities that power marketing transformation at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Open is our AI-powered platform for marketing. It connects people, data, tools, and AI into a single ecosystem, enabling teams to deliver better outcomes faster, more efficiently, and at global scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our teams of engineers, product leaders, and operators work across multiple domains to build systems that power planning, execution, and delivery for some of the world’s largest brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;WHO WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:281,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:281,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
